00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.600
And then what the
definition of a straw is.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.450
- One, two.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.240
It's a tube, but it has two holes.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:00.390
- Okay, this has zero holes
and here's my argument for why.

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:03.440
It's a tube, there is a single opening

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.750
