00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.900
But this straw has no holes right now.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.360
- But then, it's like is it really a hole

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.940
because a hole is something
you dig in the ground, right.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.730
You dig down and you build a hole

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:15.130
