with an in and out point.

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:24.560
I'm going one hole.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.259
- Some people might thing
that this is two holes.

00:01:27.259 --> 00:01:30.030
I understand that argument.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:33.350
But if you're thinking about physics wise,

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:36.780
